    {
      "text": "Woooow... $LITE CEO went out on Bloomberg today and stated:\n\nLumentum is \"effectively sold out through nearly 2029\".\n\nFrom our perspective, \"Completely Sold Out, there's no end in sight\".  With demand visibility from hyperscalers that carries them out into 2030, 2031.\n\nThe implications of these statements are enormous for photonics and remaining laser suppliers with capacity coming online like $SIVE, Sumitomo Electric, to $AAOI. \n\nWhat a crazy bottleneck that's unfolding.",
      "url": "https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2108412203514925165",
      "time": "2026-10-09 12:20",
      "cashtags": [
        "AAOI",
        "LITE",
        "SIVE.ST"
      ],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Hyperscalers are the ones ultimately funding the AI buildout. As seen with $AMZN to $GOOGL earnings commentary, the ROI is seen as wildly attractive.\n\nEven $MSFT said they’d be FCF positive during the buildout period. \n\nI was more worried about counterparty risk until OpenAI went out and raised like $168B recently.",
