      "text": "Real bubble is in VC land with private companies like Instinct… $10B valuations off 100k users while $SNAP is worth less with close to 1 Billion MAU. \n\nSupply chain stocks aren’t a bubble though, if anything names like $AAOI and others are very undervalued relative to forward growth. \n\nAnd you have demand visibility from hyperscalers extending multiple years…",
